    "detailed_description": "Graphic isometric adventure where you assume the role of a prisoner awaiting sentencing. This will be in seven days and you must find a way to escape. If they condemn you, they will transfer you to a maximum security penitentiary, and you will end up with your bones in jail forever.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe days pass and you run out of time. Ask, question, locate, change, steal ... do whatever it takes to escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo not miss daily tasks so they do not suspect. Beware of night surveillance cameras. Any favor will benefit you.",
